.TH PATRICIA_DICT_CLI 1 "September 2026" "patricia_dict 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
patricia_dict_cli \- inspect and update Android Patricia dictionaries
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B patricia_dict_cli
.I command dictionary_path
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect stored words, probabilities, context scores and shortcuts in Android
Patricia dictionaries. Formats 2, 201, 202 and 402 are read-only.
Creation and updates require format 403. No dictionary is included in this tool.
Context arguments are chronological, with the oldest word first.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BI "query " "path word"
Look up a word.
.TP
.BI "prob " "path word [context...]"
Look up a probability using preceding words.
.TP
.BI "ngrams " "path [context...]"
List stored continuations for preceding words.
.TP
.BI "scores " "path word [context...]"
Show separate probability scores for each available context length.
.TP
.BI "filter " "path [options]"
List entries matching the filter. Options are
.BR --prefix ,
.BR --suffix ,
.BR --min-len ,
.BR --max-len ,
and
.BR --limit ,
each followed by a value. Prefix and suffix options may repeat.
The limit applies to traversal results rather than ranking by probability.
.TP
.BI "shortcuts " "path word"
List shortcut targets and their stored probabilities.
.TP
.BI "count " path
Count dictionary words.
.TP
.BI "dump " path
Write all words and frequencies as word:frequency records.
.TP
.BI "info " path
Print dictionary header information.
.TP
.BI "create " "path locale"
Create an empty format 403 dictionary.
.TP
.BI "append " "path word frequency"
Add a word with an explicit stored frequency.
.TP
.BI "modify " "path word frequency"
Change a word's stored frequency.
.TP
.BI "delete " "path word"
Remove a word.
.TP
.BI "add-ngram " "path word frequency [context...]"
Store a context entry. All referenced words must already exist.
.TP
.BI "remove-ngram " "path word [context...]"
Remove a context entry.
.TP
.BI "import " path
Read word:frequency records from standard input.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero indicates success. One indicates invalid arguments, a missing word or
another operation error.
.SH EXAMPLE
.B patricia_dict_cli query /usr/share/android-patricia-dictionaries/en_US.dict hello
.SH AUTHORS
Upstream project: https://gitlab.com/InsanePrawn/android-patricia-dict
.PP
